      "tree": {
        "sha": "1460f18d8a2b66ba4f250fe03809a150408d0ac8",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bips/git/trees/1460f18d8a2b66ba4f250fe03809a150408d0ac8"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 1460f18d8a2b66ba4f250fe03809a150408d0ac8\nparent b78cb65c9292b9cc8d34ff44478af2eb18caa2af\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1788796860 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1789215897 +0200\n\nbip-0371: drop the finalizer clause from PSBT_OUT_TAP_BIP32_DERIVATION\n\nThe six taproot input fields say \"Finalizers should remove this field\nafter PSBT_IN_FINAL_SCRIPTWITNESS is constructed\", and so does the\noutput field PSBT_OUT_TAP_BIP32_DERIVATION. An output has no\nPSBT_IN_FINAL_SCRIPTWITNESS, the clause names no input, and its two\nneighbours in the output table carry no such clause. Drop it; Bitcoin\nCore does not clear output fields on finalization.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEsRUSBAxuhte14D3RTXHtOpqO38UFAmqlRJkbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEE1x7Tqajt/FPFMP/jP6xVlQT2Jgd25+8184\nUeP6DVnctAuNn3fhl8xSwweX8TLSKMt733IFxu0JJmb5ne/sZcsCcD/yO1XGl9u0\nz+ePq1lnrJQOXqUn+lawDvymxhm//3QLvhUAGIxi48UBvgrJA05UWgoBIlkxWSWa\nGj8X6sk8D3O/kdPY0krmV3gAaaWwIsVXt44Pzx5NRTUwyQRlle0VmTpspVH/uu5c\n9RPmbc3LvQuxly+WrMvVJxqbOz9TDyZF5sDybbBwRXMD4Wkjx9RnTdkPHLjfYBFZ\n1BSQOS0/ynrJ8oH7zLZoVN7bkWtmd6c//4xzOob9AgZ7b7lb2s1BZyhRqkIBJfa5\ng/eRGE8pGisd3sxQ8ucTDHsrTxQgHHEY9iwAWhpmE/rS6az+RuIUFEx0kg3YFHjG\nFIxLuHS/0G0S4Qh6A3sVjGi9HO9PsEYtVUgBfgnLxz+oG0/IhrD2v+HsrupQMZGi\nPh+lcY1GUBq6D4Wz9IXE6CdqEujEzr3kCHzjFO0f3k+KpRq8CvDRqArva/d2gla3\nr/0uwQEbn6kYsQBfORrqjfa2HiZ5TngrKF5xcNtJDsx7OBMuLQyfIGebpr4nsy+o\niTfK4Hc80bOPZLvaBiTExtdP462bRSHaCD+Ipox2cg7SjwICecklnGlJv7BoMah5\niQrAi+gi4J62BuAKXApXvRS9\n=qDON\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
